-- Camden: the old Hampstead, Belsize and South Hampstead directions also covered solar panels on roofs facing a road.
-- Camden's Single Member Decision of 27 May 2025 replaced them with near identical non immediate directions without
-- the solar part, in force 9 Jun 2026. planning.data still lists the old ones with no end date (checked 23 and 24 Oct 2026).
